<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="text-page"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE</h1><p>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE is an evolving registry of physical, postcard-sized contributions organised into editions.</p><p>Each object receives a permanent archive identifier. Its country code is descriptive metadata: multiple contributions can be associated with the same place.</p><p>Edition 01 begins in 2026. Further information will be added as the archive develops.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
